  "material_learning": "Separating a fast core from a residual trend runner can improve aggregate Validation economics, so the full-lot binary exit diagnosis was directionally useful. It did not create a credible candidate: the primary worsened capital-weighted median holding from 182.5 to 291 hours and P90 from 1418.3 to 1471.2 hours, achieved zero of five annual holding wins, lost 6.88558271 USDT versus V1 in 2022, and increased Design maximum drawdown from 29.530448 to 41.915663 percent. Both neighbors preserved the same zero-of-five holding breadth failure. The exact split family is closed instead of tuning allocation or triggers around a small aggregate Validation uplift.",
